            <span class="lvg-truth-chapters__label">
              Chapter three
            </span>
          

          
            <h2>
              The loop is not a conspiracy.<br>
 It is an incentive.
            </h2>
          

          

            <div class="lvg-truth-chapters__two">

              
                <div>
                  <p>Nobody in this industry sat down and designed a trap. What happened is simpler, and harder to fix: the category is economically rewarded for multiplying concerns, ingredients and steps. A routine that grows is a routine that sells. A woman who has resolved her skin buys one thing a year.</p>
                </div>
              

              
                <div>
                  <p>That incentive does not need anyone to act in bad faith in order to work. It only needs nobody to have a reason to stop it. The rupee sits at the centre of the loop because it is why the loop keeps turning — not because somebody is standing there holding it.</p>
                </div>
              

            </div>

          

        </div>


        

        

          
          

          

          


          

