            </span>
          

          
            <h2>
              The real cost is not <br>
the money.
            </h2>
          

          

            <div class="lvg-truth-chapters__two">

              
                <div>
                  <p>Money is the easy part to count. What the loop actually takes is trust — in products, in claims, and eventually in your own judgement. By the fourth or fifth cycle you are not simply tired of buying. You have stopped believing anyone.</p><p>That is the state most people arrive at this brand in. Not looking for another active. Looking for a reason to trust something again.</p>
                </div>
              

              

