            <div class="lvg-truth-chapters__two">

              
                <div>
                  <p>This is the first thing LNGVTY has to say, and it comes before everything else on this site. Not because it is a kind thing to say, but because it is the accurate one.</p><p>Nothing else in this story works until that is settled.</p>
